# iHomeland repository ignore rules
# 仅忽略可重建产物、本机状态和敏感配置；协议源、fixture、lock/checksum 与 Unity 正常资产必须进入 Git。

## 本机自动化与临时环境
/.agents/
/.codex/
/.local/
/.tmp/

## 敏感环境配置
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

## Go 服务端
/server/bin/
/server/coverage/
/server/coverage.out
/server/coverage.html
/server/**/*.test
/server/**/*.test.exe
/server/.local/

## 协议生成代码
# Proto/OpenAPI、registry 与 fixtures 是源和兼容性基线，不得在此忽略。
/server/internal/generated/proto/
/client/Assets/App/Generated/
/client/Assets/App/Generated.meta

## Unity 客户端本机目录
/client/[Ll]ibrary/
/client/[Tt]emp/
/client/[Oo]bj/
/client/[Ll]ogs/
/client/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/client/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
/client/[Rr]ecordings/

## Unity 构建输出
/client/[Bb]uild/
/client/[Bb]uilds/

## Unity 与 IDE 自动生成的项目文件
/client/*.csproj
/client/*.unityproj
/client/*.sln
/client/*.slnx
/client/UIElementsSchema/

## IDE 本机状态
.run/
.idea/
.vs/
.history/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs

.vscode/

## Windows 生成文件
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
